//MARTY Def File
//Format:
//MARTYMod
//{
//	ExpType Architect (Can be Architect or NonArchitect - the mod will track that type of XP gain)
//	Action	Log (Can be Log or Throttle - the mod will take the specified action when the rate limiter is tripped, whether to log or throttle+log)
//	LogMessage "Architect Medium" (Custom message to append to the log when this mod is tripped, should indicate which mod was tripped)
//	Level	<level number (0 indexed)>	<xp per 1 minute> <xp 5 min> <xp 15 min> <xp 30 min> <xp 60 min> <xp 120 min> (Each rate is the bucket fill target, not the per minute rate)
//	(All levels must be represented)
//}

